cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and credit its sources."
type: dataset
title: "Morocco communes"
abstract: >-
  Morocco's régions, provinces and préfectures, cercles, communes and arrondissements,
  with official HCP geographic codes, names in French and Arabic, population from the
  2014 and 2024 censuses, HCP's census indicators from both, and boundaries from
  OpenStreetMap.
